{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dd060efe-0d6a-8999-bb5c-20f94665e837",
  "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:25:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Conceicao Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:20:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, hello, thank you for picking up. I know it's Sunday and City Hall is closed, so I'm calling the storm line, the number on the recording. Is this right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:20-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I manage a property on Van Zandt Avenue, number thirty-five, in the North End. After the nor'easter Friday and Saturday, yesterday it finished, the driveway apron in front has a puddle that just sits there. And it doesn't go to the street. It drains back toward the garage door. That's the problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Toward the garage door, so the water's running onto the property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, exactly. Toward the garage. And this is not the first time, it keeps happening when we get a big rain. Nobody ever does anything. Sorry, I'm rambling, I know you want just the facts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:22:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. Is there a storm drain nearby, and is it blocked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:22:10-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a drain at the curb, close to the driveway. I think it's full of leaves and, like, sand. And the sidewalk, oh, the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. All the way across. Somebody could slip. The water came down the street carrying everything and left it there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:22:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so mud and debris on the sidewalk, and the drain by the driveway looks clogged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:22:40-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Thank you. Let me check, the drain is by the driveway, the puddle is on the apron, the mud is on the sidewalk. Right? Okay. And can I ask, is that a city drain or a state one? Because somebody told me before maybe the state, and I don't know who to call. Sorry, I'm confusing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not confusing at all. Van Zandt is a city street, so a drain at the curb there would normally be ours. I'll put it in as a city catch basin, and if it turns out to be state, we pass it along ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:23:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's good, thank you. Because I called somewhere else last year and they said call someone else, and then another person, you know. Going around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:23:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you're not going around today. Is the water getting inside the garage right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:23:42-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not now, it's a little bit dry today, but the puddle is still there. If it rains again, then yes, I think it goes under the door. The tenant already moved boxes up. I told her I would call. Sorry, I talk too much, but she is very upset, and the owner too, he asks me every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:24:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's your job, they should be glad you called. Let me get a few things. Van Zandt Avenue, number thirty-five, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:24:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thirty-five Van Zandt Avenue. Thirty-five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:24:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:24:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:24:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-six. Name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:24:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Conceicao Furtado. C-O-N-C-E-I-C-A-O. Furtado, F-U-R-T-A-D-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:24:34-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'm sending this to the drain crew as a clogged catch basin with standing water at the driveway and mud on the sidewalk. They're stacked up after the storm, so it may be a few days, but it's logged for first thing tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a few days, tomorrow it is logged. Thank you. And the sidewalk mud, they clean also, or is that me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The crew clears the drain and what's right around it. Sweeping the rest of the sidewalk is usually on the property. I'd get a shovel on it before it dries hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:25:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay, I understand, I will tell the maintenance guy. Thank you, thank you very much. I'm sorry again for talking so long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a problem. Take care, Ms. Furtado."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye-bye."
    }
  ],
